{"id":"3df79cde2a855bea","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-i-delta-zero-division.md","title":"IΔ₀中的欧几里得除法","display":"thm-i-delta-zero-division — IΔ₀中的欧几里得除法","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-i-delta-zero-division","aliases":["72-thm-i-delta-zero-division"],"display":"thm-i-delta-zero-division — IΔ₀中的欧几里得除法","depends_on":["[[72-df-division-remainder-graphs]]","[[72-df-i-delta-0]]"],"chapter":"II","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.II §1.2.8(c),(d), print89/PDF101; local explicit quotient-remainder argument","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-i-delta-zero-division"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-i-delta-zero-division</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-i-delta-zero-division — IΔ₀中的欧几里得除法"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7c6f8c60d0c340bd\" href=\"?note=7c6f8c60d0c340bd\" title=\"72-df-division-remainder-graphs\">72-df-division-remainder-graphs</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0e5e75be5dd53241\" href=\"?note=0e5e75be5dd53241\" title=\"72-df-i-delta-0\">72-df-i-delta-0</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"II"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.II §1.2.8(c),(d), print89/PDF101; local explicit quotient-remainder argument"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q&#39;,r&#39;\">\\(q&#39;,r&#39;\\)</span> 为避开 x,y,q,r 的互异新鲜数变量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G:=\\operatorname{QRGraph}(x,y,q,r)\">\\(G:=\\operatorname{QRGraph}(x,y,q,r)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G&#39;:=G[q&#39;/q][r&#39;/r]\">\\(G&#39;:=G[q&#39;/q][r&#39;/r]\\)</span>。所有可证性取固定含等号一阶演算。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"I\\Delta_0\\vdash\\forall x\\forall y\\exists q\\le x\\exists r\\le x\\\n\\bigl[G\\land\\forall q&#39;\\forall r&#39;(G&#39;\\to(q&#39;=q\\land r&#39;=r))\\bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[I\\Delta_0\\vdash\\forall x\\forall y\\exists q\\le x\\exists r\\le x\\\n\\bigl[G\\land\\forall q&#39;\\forall r&#39;(G&#39;\\to(q&#39;=q\\land r&#39;=r))\\bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"I\\Delta_0\\vdash\\forall x\\forall y\\forall q\\\n(\\operatorname{DivGraph}(x,y,q)\\leftrightarrow\\exists r\\le x\\ \\operatorname{QRGraph}(x,y,q,r)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[I\\Delta_0\\vdash\\forall x\\forall y\\forall q\\\n(\\operatorname{DivGraph}(x,y,q)\\leftrightarrow\\exists r\\le x\\ \\operatorname{QRGraph}(x,y,q,r)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>零除数直接取 q=0、r=x。固定正 y，对 x 用有界公式归纳保持 q,r≤x 及 x=yq+r、r&lt;y：若 r+1&lt;y 则只增余数，若 r+1=y 则商加一、余数归零。序离散性给两种穷尽情形。若有两个不同商，设较小者为 q，则另一个至少 q+1，结合两个余数小于 y 得 x&lt;y(q+1)≤x，矛盾；商相同后取消加法得余数相同。商图与商余图的等价用截断减法取得 r=x−yq。这里的全性是固定图的定理，不扩展为任意递归函数都在 IΔ₀ 内全。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-division-remainder-graphs","status":"resolved","id":"7c6f8c60d0c340bd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-division-remainder-graphs]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-i-delta-0","status":"resolved","id":"0e5e75be5dd53241","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-i-delta-0]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"q',r'","display":false},{"tex":"G:=\\operatorname{QRGraph}(x,y,q,r)","display":false},{"tex":"G':=G[q'/q][r'/r]","display":false},{"tex":"I\\Delta_0\\vdash\\forall x\\forall y\\exists q\\le x\\exists r\\le x\\\n\\bigl[G\\land\\forall q'\\forall r'(G'\\to(q'=q\\land r'=r))\\bigr].","display":true},{"tex":"I\\Delta_0\\vdash\\forall x\\forall y\\forall q\\\n(\\operatorname{DivGraph}(x,y,q)\\leftrightarrow\\exists r\\le x\\ \\operatorname{QRGraph}(x,y,q,r)).","display":true}],"bytes":1799,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-31","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"II章新增9项：[[72-df-bounded-unique-arithmetic-graph]] · [[72-df-division-remainder-graphs]] · [[72-df-truncated-subtraction-graph]] · [[72-df-unique-function-definition-extension]] · [[72-lem-bounded-function-occurrence-elimination]] · [[72-thm-i-delta-zero-division]] · [[72-thm-i-delta-zero-minimization]] · [[72-thm-i-delta-zero-subtraction]] · [[72-thm-unique-function-definition-conservative]]"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-27","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"II章新增9项：[[72-df-bounded-unique-arithmetic-graph]] · [[72-df-division-remainder-graphs]] · [[72-df-truncated-subtraction-graph]] · [[72-df-unique-function-definition-extension]] · [[72-lem-bounded-function-occurrence-elimination]] · [[72-thm-i-delta-zero-division]] · [[72-thm-i-delta-zero-minimization]] · [[72-thm-i-delta-zero-subtraction]] · [[72-thm-unique-function-definition-conservative]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-25","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"II章新增9项：[[72-df-bounded-unique-arithmetic-graph]] · [[72-df-division-remainder-graphs]] · [[72-df-truncated-subtraction-graph]] · [[72-df-unique-function-definition-extension]] · [[72-lem-bounded-function-occurrence-elimination]] · [[72-thm-i-delta-zero-division]] · [[72-thm-i-delta-zero-minimization]] · [[72-thm-i-delta-zero-subtraction]] · [[72-thm-unique-function-definition-conservative]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-27","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"II章新增9项：[[72-df-bounded-unique-arithmetic-graph]] · [[72-df-division-remainder-graphs]] · [[72-df-truncated-subtraction-graph]] · [[72-df-unique-function-definition-extension]] · [[72-lem-bounded-function-occurrence-elimination]] · [[72-thm-i-delta-zero-division]] · [[72-thm-i-delta-zero-minimization]] · [[72-thm-i-delta-zero-subtraction]] · [[72-thm-unique-function-definition-conservative]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-27","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"II章新增9项：[[72-df-bounded-unique-arithmetic-graph]] · [[72-df-division-remainder-graphs]] · [[72-df-truncated-subtraction-graph]] · [[72-df-unique-function-definition-extension]] · [[72-lem-bounded-function-occurrence-elimination]] · [[72-thm-i-delta-zero-division]] · [[72-thm-i-delta-zero-minimization]] · [[72-thm-i-delta-zero-subtraction]] · [[72-thm-unique-function-definition-conservative]]"},{"id":"5d6d95eb13748e1d","anchor":"ref-27","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"II章新增9项：[[72-df-bounded-unique-arithmetic-graph]] · [[72-df-division-remainder-graphs]] · [[72-df-truncated-subtraction-graph]] · [[72-df-unique-function-definition-extension]] · [[72-lem-bounded-function-occurrence-elimination]] · [[72-thm-i-delta-zero-division]] · [[72-thm-i-delta-zero-minimization]] · [[72-thm-i-delta-zero-subtraction]] · [[72-thm-un